      "content": "\"Now, folks, we've always known how things ought to be done here in the South, and that tradition is what makes this place special. We built this state on a certain way of life, a way that respects the natural order of things. To suddenly toss out the wisdom of generations for some radical notion from up North is just foolishness that threatens the very soul of our community. We must stand firm and protect the way things have always been.\"",
